  "decisions": [
    "RetainedPackage keeps manifest, admitted FileAccess and copied/extracted byte usage; actual work and closure belong to existing registry/JobQueue owners. No replacement output cache or scheduler.",
    "Registry no longer charges 128 MiB for derivative outputs absent from canonical package handles. Unchanged 64 GiB pool admits two exact 32 GiB queued reservations, rejects third, and releases charges after cancellation; four-owner bound remains.",
    "Native-held registry submit borrows actual workspace/source descriptors through current readMediaProbe; lsof asserts native inherited inode identities before close. Actual native drain, pre-expiry namespace revocation and cleanup remain.",
    "Wrapper-only retry/cancel/forget and more-than-32 derivative request recycling retire with flat adapters; generic context scheduling/cancellation/retry/metadata bounds remain in already banked core jobs suite. Bounded terminal receipt case remains.",
    "Core removal limited to obsolete package-manifest module/test/export and RevisionStore.pinPackageSnapshot. Its diagnostic projection assertion retires; complete source diagnostic assertion already exists in capture-store.test.ts. No other legacy core owner removed.",
    "Personal-release script still uses old selectors and remains explicitly pending later caller cutover. Source admission/normalization, current metadata adoption, publication, workspace and inherited native lock owners remain."
  ],
  "review": "Parent independently reviewed final archive/registry/lifetime/capacity/README/discovery and core package-manifest export/pin delta: clean; source frozen before commit.",
